WEBVTT

00:26:57.579 --> 00:27:02.121
Even if we with our words are saying like,
oh, no, I'm fine, just leave me alone.

00:27:02.121 --> 00:27:05.871
And in so many ways, that's, you know,
when you turn to drugs, for example,

00:27:06.288 --> 00:27:09.621
you know, that's a way of of pushing
others away from you. Right.

00:27:09.913 --> 00:27:14.788
And yet what I was so clearly trying to do
, I can see, is to be like, help me,

00:27:14.788 --> 00:27:19.746
help me, help me. And it's also a kind of
test. So it's a signal. I need help.

00:27:19.871 --> 00:27:24.246
It's a test. Is there anyone out there
who loves me enough to help me?

00:27:26.954 --> 00:27:32.413
I also think in my case, there was
this sort of division within me